conventional s-wave (l = 0, left) and unconventional d-wave
(l = 2, right) superconductors. Right panel: Odd parity pwave (l = 1, left) and even-parity d-wave (l = 2, right) chargechannel Pomeranchuk instabilities of the Fermi surface. Thin
